  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Ibrahim",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Ibrahim.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Daniel Ibrahim (MED0002308606) completed his medical degree at the University of New South Wales. He worked for a number of years at both St George and Sutherland Hospitals before commencing a career in General Practice. He has a particular interest in skin cancer medicine/surgical procedures, sports injuries, preventative health and chronic disease management.",
      "Outside of work, Daniel enjoys watching and playing sports including football, as well as spending time with family."
    ]
